# Data Warehouse Analytics Project

## Business Objective
To provide actionable insights from sales data by:
- Identifying top-performing products and customers
- Analyzing sales trends over time
- Segmenting customers for targeted marketing
- Evaluating product performance across categories

## Technical Scope
- **Data Exploration**: 50+ analytical queries
- **Metrics Calculated**: 20+ KPIs
- **Analytical Methods**:
  - Descriptive analytics
  - Time-series analysis
  - Customer/product segmentation
  - Part-to-whole relationships
- **Output**: 2 production-ready views for BI integration

